Z||000003||FieroLisa||01-23-2001||08:24 AM||||I went to my first Fiero show with my coupe before I did anything with it- crappy interior/ bad paint. Anyway, just join me in the daily driver class with your car the way it is. Someone tried to pry my wing off on my GT that I'm taking with a crowbar, and it needs repainted, but it'll get done...eventually  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Anyway I'm driving down from NC on Thursday if you care to join!<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 gold 4 speed GT<BR>86 gold 5 speed SC (Sold!)<BR>Columbus, OH/Greensboro NC<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/pffsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Songman||01-23-2001||10:24 AM||||Drive it! Rental cars are a waste of money! For what you pay for the rental you could get your fascias painted.. or at least pretty close to the same amount. As far as I know, no company will rent cars without a credit card.<P>For future reference... get a Visa check card from your bank that is attached to your checking account. Will work for things like rental cars and is really a lot easier than writing checks. I don't use credit cards because I refuse to be subject to 21% interest (or more) but the check card is great! Keeps me from buying more than I can afford too!<P>Hope to see you in Daytona! I'll hopefully be in a freshly painted and decaled Indy Pace Car. If not, I'll be in a bad paint and no decaled Indy Pace Car. Either way, me and the car will be there! hehe<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
